The parity-corrected family now has 140 vertices at `easy`, balanced parity classes, exactly one witness among 1,843,175 admissible candidates, and a measured 280-operation compact route. The earlier scratch arm used the superseded 92-vertex build, so I stopped it and am restarting the official bare run on the corrected shipping candidate.
